innovations.desc:
Create Responsible is the first e-cooperative in Slovenia to use a digital platform to support, connect and empower freelancers, part-time workers and the unemployed, particularly those in the creative sector. The core function of the platform is to create an online space in which designers and artists can connect with industry professionals and with each other. Through this online space, the cooperative aims to help creative workers to:
maximise their chances of finding decent work;
find partnerships with other creative workers;
share concerns, challenges and solutions related to freelancing;
access training to expand their skillset and knowledge base, to remain competitive in the markets they operate in.
